msgid ""
"| Spoken (product/design)         | Repository term                                                                      | Typical home                  |\n"
"| ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n"
"| Non-business / design-system UI | **Primitive**, **structure**, **composite**                                          | `@freeanima/ui-kit`           |\n"
"| Business / product UI           | **Domain** UI                                                                        | `src/features/<slug>/ui`      |\n"
"| UI component                    | A React building block at one of the layers above                                    | —                             |\n"
"| UI element / slot piece         | Presentational part inside a pattern (title text, badge, icon) — not its own package | Inside a component or pattern |\n"
"| App chrome                      | **app frame** (not Shell)                                                            | `src/client/app-frame`        |\n"
"| Host                            | **Shell**                                                                            | `src/portal/app/*`            |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 结构                           | 角色                                                                                                                          |\n"
"| -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| Memory system                    | 数字生命的“家”                                                                                                               |\n"
"| Self layer（六个区块）           | “我是谁”的持久定义                                                                                                           |\n"
"| Tools（local / MCP / ACP）       | 用于感知与行动的“肢体”                                                                                                       |\n"
"| pass credentials                 | 生命线（运行时注入，绝不明文）                                                                                               |\n"
"| Gateway                          | 耳朵与嘴巴（Discord / WeChat / **Habitat）                                                                                       |\n"
"| EventBus                         | 异步通知传输（Redis 队列）；睡眠使用 Pipeline Runner，而非 EventBus——见 [`architecture.md`](architecture.md)                |\n"
"| `AGENTS.md` 等项目叙事文件       | 项目上下文的锚点                                                                                                             |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Self Layer"
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "自我层"

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Layer         | Role                                                                                                | Location                       |\n"
"| ------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n"
"| **Primitive** | shadcn/Radix controls + variants (`Button`, `Dialog`, `Input`, …)                                   | `ui-kit/components/ui`         |\n"
"| **Structure** | Form and layout shells (`FormFieldset`, `ListDetailLayout`, viewport hooks)                         | `ui-kit/form`, `ui-kit/layout` |\n"
"| **Composite** | Cross-feature interaction patterns (`ConfirmDialog`, `ActionSheet`, `ContextMenu`, `EmptyState`, …) | `ui-kit/composite`             |\n"
"| **Domain**    | Product-specific screens and fields                                                                 | `features/<slug>/ui`           |\n"
"| **app frame** | Module rail / tabs / settings host                                                                  | `client/app-frame`             |\n"
"| **Shell**     | Portal host, IPC, bridge                                                                            | `portal/app`                   |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:34
msgid ""
"Dependency direction: `app-frame` → `features/*/ui` → `{ui-kit, portal-sdk}` "
"→ shared. `ui-kit` must not import Habitat RPC / `rpc-contract`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/ui/components.md:35
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Client profiles"
msgid "Placement rules"
msgstr "客户端配置"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"If two features need the same interaction chassis, put the chassis in "
"**composite** (or structure/layout); keep field copy and domain types in the "
"feature."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid "Primitives stay dumb: variants and sizes, no feature imports."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"Composites take **capability props** (e.g. `useActionSheet: boolean`) or "
"call portal-sdk **interaction** hooks — they must not call `getShellKind()` "
"to choose ContextMenu vs ActionSheet."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"Layout structure components may use **layout** APIs (`useCompactLayout`, "
"`useDrawerNav`, …)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: docs/ui/components.md:42
msgid ""
"Shell-only concerns stay in portal-sdk / shell host; ui-kit does not export "
"shell detectors."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/ui/components.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Pending alignment:** Task-oriented views under `ui-kit/composite` (`TaskItemRowView`, …) are shared reference implementations. Prefer aligning new list modules to their **pattern contract** ([patterns.md](patterns.md)); extracting a generic `ListRow` is a follow-up task, not a license to fork row behavior.\n"
msgstr ""

